+            "flowchart TD\n  A --> X{check}\n  X -->|ok| B\n  X -->|not ok| C\n",
+            "flowchart TD\n  B -->|valid| A[Accept]\n  C -->|invalid| A\n",
+            "flowchart TD\n  A[Start] -->|yes| B\n  A -->|no| C\n  A -->|maybe| D\n  A -->|later| E\n",
